Error [E0740]: `env_only` uses the effect `FS.Read`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/time_zone_effects.jet:5:29
    |
  5 | fn env_only(name: String) -[Env]> Zone TimeError! { time.zone(name) }
    |                             ^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[Env]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read` to the effect list, or stop using it in `env_only`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: env_only
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740

