Error [E3401]: `pure` calls the impure function `core_time::zone`
  --> tests/ui/time_zone_effects.jet:4:51
    |
  4 | fn pure(name: String) -[]> Zone TimeError! { time.zone(name) }
    |                                                   ^^^^
 Why: `core_time::zone` is impure, but `pure` declares `-[]>`
 Fix: Remove the call from `pure`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `pure` so its effects are inferred
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: pure → core_time::zone
